  questTitle: 'Teamwork makes the dream work! '
  introSubtitles:
  - "That\u2019s enough chit chat! Maybe you noticed, you can\u2019t hear other party
    while using your radio. So please don\u2019t interrupt when someone\u2019s speaking.
    We call this effective communication."
  - "Now it\u2019s time for some collaboration! In case of any system malfunction,
    Engineer has a station manual explaining how to fix stations. However it\u2019s
    on the other side of Engineer\u2019s door."
  - "Technician! Use your lever to open Engineer\u2019s door for 5 seconds. Why?
    Because we call this\u2026 Teamwork!"
